      "markdown": "Resolve any conflicts with contractors as soon as they arise. If unresolved, involve a senior level authority to mediate and help settle the dispute.",
      "plain_text": "Resolve any conflicts with contractors as soon as they arise. If unresolved, involve a senior level authority to mediate and help settle the dispute."
