      "markdown": "Should escalation to a senior authority not resolve the dispute, you should inform the contractor in writing about the alternative dispute resolution (ADR) services available through the Office of the Procurement Ombud (OPO).",
      "plain_text": "Should escalation to a senior authority not resolve the dispute, you should inform the contractor in writing about the alternative dispute resolution (ADR) services available through the Office of the Procurement Ombud (OPO)."
