        "Buyer's Guide",
        "Contract dispute resolution",
        "Dispute Management"
      ],
      "markdown": "Any party to a contract can request assistance from OPO for dispute management. Upon request for ADR services, the OPO program will inform all parties involved and assess their interest in the process. If the parties agree, the ADR process will commence.",
      "plain_text": "Any party to a contract can request assistance from OPO for dispute management. Upon request for ADR services, the OPO program will inform all parties involved and assess their interest in the process. If the parties agree, the ADR process will commence."
